}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"7ea23ad4-8830-47d4-a404-c973688fe8b3"],

Cell["A chord joins two particles whose pairing value is nonzero.", "Notes",
 CellFrameLabels->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {Inherited, 
    Cell[
     TextData[{
      "26.09.30: Design review - ChordContraction is exported because it is \
the one term the bracket and the co-bracket share, and the published notebook \
shows the chord sum term by term, which the API could not before the decision \
of 2026-09-21. The joining and the cutting term share the name and differ in \
arity, two words against one, each with its position pair. It is the one \
operation of the paclet that takes no word as the list of its particles, \
because its position pair is a list too. A position outside the word, or two \
equal positions in the cutting form, match no definition and return \
unevaluated; no alternative was recorded. The function reads the pairing \
value, the degrees and the convention off the GradedPairing object, so \
CanonicalLieBracket and CanonicalLieCobracket are plain sums of it. Prior \
art: the Wolfram Language has no cyclic words or chord diagrams; the \
verification suites pin the chord sums against CanonicalLieBracket and \
CanonicalLieCobracket, which they pin against the bracket and the co-bracket \
of the engine.", "\n\n", 
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         GridBox[{{
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Edit"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationButton"]]], 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "LastAnnotator"]], "pavel"}], 
             "TextAnnotator"], 
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Delete"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationRemoveButton"]]], ""}}, 
          GridBoxAlignment -> {
           "Columns" -> {Left, Left, Right, Right}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, 
          GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.68], 
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.02]}}]]], "\n"}], "TextAnnotation", 
     CellSize -> {590, Inherited}]}},
 CellTags->"TextAnnotation",
 CellID->192346944,ExpressionUUID->"671fddd0-20c7-4b75-9ed9-71745ef2778f"],

Cell["\<\
Between two words the chord joins the two circles into one: the two \
contracted particles are removed, and the two remainders are concatenated, \
each read cyclically from the particle after the contracted one.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"09ad892b-4b7e-40cf-8ae7-d2deefee08a9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On one word the chord cuts the circle into two: the arc from ",
 StyleBox["i", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["j", "TI"],
 " and the arc from ",
 StyleBox["j", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["i", "TI"],
 ", each without its endpoints."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3dbd8e57-e2d4-4b28-a8b7-653db99812ea"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The value is the pairing value of the two particles, times the Koszul sign \
of the convention of ",
 StyleBox["pairing", "TI"],
 ", times the resulting word, or product of two words, in canonical form."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ffb41297-50b4-4351-a918-fbdb19be8186"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Convention\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dc2954c3-431c-4da1-a43f-6411bf16be9e"],
 " key of ",
 StyleBox["pairing", "TI"],
 " selects the sign, and in the cutting form also the head of the product: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SymmetricProduct"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/SymmetricProduct",
     "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c288b01c-a1a8-43dd-a8e4-ef99320526eb"],
 " under ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Symmetric\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "89aeedff-8d9b-4a6d-8d6c-d88b098dc3a8"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ExteriorProduct"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/ExteriorProduct", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "366804cd-f064-4c6b-8308-c669b644b1c7"],
 " under ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exterior\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f6707b97-e0a8-4712-b69f-44f3ad1f2988"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"85032904-a89a-439c-bb5c-e9ce6920011a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CanonicalLieBracket"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/CanonicalLieBracket", 
